www.facebook.com/degrey.saigon/posts/2244543462305470/?locale=vi_VN"><strong>Degrey – Mang thời trang đến gần underground (Degrey x Blacka)</strong></a></h4><div style="text-align: justify;" class="_1mf _1mj"><p style="text-align: center"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/degrey.saigon/posts/2244543462305470/?locale=vi_VN"><img src="//file.hstatic.net/1000281824/file/project-degrey_0ca096046bf64dd3becbffed5662907c.png"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div class="_1mf _1mj"><div data-oembed-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FXxF19jJwMk&amp;t=23s"><div style="max-width:320px;margin:auto;"><!-- You're using demo endpoint of Iframely API commercially. Max-width is limited to 320px. Please get your own API key at https://iframely.com. --><div style="left: 0; width: 100%; height: 0; position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%;"><iframe tabindex="-1" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/FXxF19jJwMk?rel=0&amp;start=23" style="border: 0; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; position: absolute;" scrolling="no" allow="encrypted-media; accelerometer; clipboard-write; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"></iframe></div></div></div></div><div style="text-align: justify;" class="_1mf _1mj">&nbsp;</div><div class="_1mf _1mj"><div data-oembed-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gEJKVTKAhvE"><div style="max-width:320px;margin:auto;"><!-- You're using demo endpoint of Iframely API commercially. Max-width is limited to 320px. Please get your own API key at https://iframely.com. --><div style="left: 0; width: 100%; height: 0; position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%;"><iframe tabindex="-1" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/gEJKVTKAhvE?rel=0" style="border: 0; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; position: absolute;" scrolling="no" allow="encrypted-media; accelerometer; clipboard-write; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"></iframe></div></div></div><p style="text-align: justify;"><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=2141965986014794"><strong>Degrey x Dossin (Foudation wind Jacket)&nbsp;</strong></a></p></div><div class="_1mf _1mj"><div data-oembed-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jlLd9unvGss"><div style="max-width:320px;margin:auto;"><!-- You're using demo endpoint of Iframely API commercially. Max-width is limited to 320px. Please get your own API key at https://iframely.com. --><div style="left: 0; width: 100%; height: 0; position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%;"><iframe tabindex="-1" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/jlLd9unvGss?rel=0" style="border: 0; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; position: absolute;" scrolling="no" allow="encrypted-media; accelerometer; clipboard-write; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"></iframe></div></div></div></div><div style="text-align: justify;" class="_1mf _1mj">Sản phẩm được lấy cảm hứng từ album "Foundation Vol. 4" của rapper tài năng Basick, quán quân cuộc thi “Show Me The Money" mùa 4."Chúng ta luôn phải tuân theo quy luật của cuộc sống.Nhưng với thời trang thì KHÔNG.Chúng tôi thoải mái làm những điều khác biệt.VÌ VẬY CHÚNG TÔI TÌM ĐẾN NHAU".......</div><h4 style="text-align: justify;" class="_1mf _1mj"><br><a href="http://https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=754349858105316"><strong>Degrey&nbsp;x Dirty Coins (Make love Not war)</strong></a></h4><div class="_1mf _1mj"><div data-oembed-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hZLzbjN3yYE"><div style="max-width:320px;margin:auto;"><!-- You're using demo endpoint of Iframely API commercially. Max-width is limited to 320px. Please get your own API key at https://iframely.com. --><div style="left: 0; width: 100%; height: 0; position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%;"><iframe tabindex="-1" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/hZLzbjN3yYE?rel=0" style="border: 0; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; position: absolute;" scrolling="no" allow="encrypted-media; accelerometer; clipboard-write; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"></iframe></div></div></div></div><div style="text-align: justify;" class="_1mf _1mj">Degrey với các dự án đồng hành cùng Dirty coins không còn gì xa lạ đối với các bạn. Thông qua bst lần này, tụi mình muốn nhắn nhủ thông điệp thế giới cần tình yêu, hãy tạo yêu thương đừng gây chiến tranh.....</div><div style="text-align: justify;" class="_1mf _1mj">&nbsp;</div><h4 style="text-align: justify;" class="_1mf _1mj"><strong><a href="https://degrey.vn/blogs/news/degrey-x-dat-g">Degrey&nbsp;x Đạt G</a></strong></h4><div style="text-align: justify;" class="_1mf _1mj"><div class="_1mf _1mj"><div class="_1mf _1mj"><div data-oembed-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rO92dxA-Ftc"><div style="max-width:320px;margin:auto;"><!-- You're using demo endpoint of Iframely API commercially. Max-width is limited to 320px. Please get your own API key at https://iframely.com. --><div style="left: 0; width: 100%; height: 0; position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%;"><iframe tabindex="-1" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/rO92dxA-Ftc?rel=0" style="border: 0; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; position: absolute;" scrolling="no" allow="encrypted-media; accelerometer; clipboard-write; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"></iframe></div></div></div><p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="display:none">&nbsp;</span></p></div></div><h4><br><strong>Một số dự án khác:</strong></h4></div><div style="text-align: justify;" class="_1mf _1mj"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/cxg.vn/posts/1228362480919583/">Degrey x Cối Xay Gió&nbsp;</a></div><div style="text-align: justify;" class="_1mf _1mj"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/photo?fbid=1470815350063818&amp;set=a.343612512784113">Degrey x Colkids</a></div><div style="text-align: justify;" class="_1mf _1mj"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/degrey.saigon/posts/2667003790059433/">Degrey x Sly</a></div><div style="text-align: justify;" class="_1mf _1mj">........</div><div class="_1mf _1mj"><p style="text-align: center"><img src="//file.hstatic.net/1000281824/file/12dg_840bf0a6214b40b4a66223ed233ba702.png"></p><p style="text-align: center">&nbsp;</p><p style="text-